<section class="section topic" id="unit2">
<div class="container">
<div class="section-title">
<div class="eyebrow">Unit 2 · 10 Periods</div>
<h2>Force and Motion / बल एवं गति</h2>
<p>Vectors, momentum, impulse, circular motion, central force and gravitation.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="topic-header">
<div class="topic-number">2.1</div>
<div>
<h3>Scalar and Vector Quantities</h3>
<p>Scalar में केवल magnitude; vector में magnitude और direction दोनों।</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="table-wrap">
<table>
<tr><th>Scalar</th><th>Vector</th></tr>
<tr><td>Only magnitude</td><td>Magnitude + direction</td></tr>
<tr><td>Examples: mass, time, temperature, energy, speed</td><td>Examples: displacement, velocity, acceleration, force, momentum</td></tr>
<tr><td>Ordinary algebra generally sufficient</td><td>Vector laws are required</td></tr>
</table>
</div>

<h4>Types of Vectors / Vectors के प्रकार</h4>
<ul>
<li>Unit vector</li>
<li>Zero vector</li>
<li>Equal vectors</li>
<li>Negative vector</li>
<li>Parallel vectors</li>
<li>Anti-parallel vectors</li>
<li>Co-initial vectors</li>
<li>Coplanar vectors</li>
</ul>

<div class="diagram">
<div class="diagram-title">Vector Representation</div>
<svg viewBox="0 0 900 260">
<defs>
<marker id="arrow2" markerWidth="12" markerHeight="12" refX="10" refY="5" orient="auto">
