<h3>Unit 2 Formula Sheet</h3>
<div class="formula">
p = mv<br>
F = dp/dt<br>
J = FΔt = Δp<br>
R = √(A²+B²+2ABcosθ)<br>
v = rω<br>
aₜ = rα<br>
a_c = v²/r = rω²<br>
F_c = mv²/r<br>
F_g = Gm₁m₂/r²<br>
tanθ = v²/(rg)  [ideal road banking]
</div>
</div>
