</div>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="topic-header">
<div class="topic-number">3.6</div>
<div>
<h3>Power / शक्ति</h3>
<p>Work करने की rate को power कहते हैं।</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="formula">
Power P = Work/time = W/t<br>
For constant velocity: P = Fv
</div>

<div class="table-wrap">
<table>
<tr><th>Quantity</th><th>SI Unit</th><th>Symbol</th></tr>
<tr><td>Work/Energy</td><td>joule</td><td>J</td></tr>
<tr><td>Power</td><td>watt</td><td>W</td></tr>
<tr><td>1 kilowatt</td><td>1000 watt</td><td>kW</td></tr>
</table>
</div>

<div class="note">Power tells how quickly work is done; energy tells how much capacity/work is involved.</div>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>Unit 3 Formula Sheet</h3>
<div class="formula">
W = Fs cosθ<br>
F_lim = μN<br>
K.E. = 1/2 mv²<br>
P.E. = mgh<br>
Mechanical Energy = K.E. + P.E.<br>
P = W/t<br>
P = Fv
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

