</svg>
</div>

<p>Stress-strain curve سے material की stiffness, elastic behavior, yield behavior और failure tendency के बारे में information मिलती है।</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="topic-header">
<div class="topic-number">5.2</div>
<div>
<h3>Pressure / दाब</h3>
<p>Unit area पर perpendicular force को pressure कहते हैं।</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="formula">
P = F/A
</div>

<h4>Pressure Types</h4>
<div class="grid-3">
<div class="info-box"><strong>Atmospheric</strong><span>Atmosphere द्वारा लगाया गया pressure.</span></div>
<div class="info-box"><strong>Gauge</strong><span>Atmospheric pressure के relative measured pressure.</span></div>
<div class="info-box"><strong>Absolute</strong><span>Vacuum reference से measured total pressure.</span></div>
</div>

<div class="formula">
P_absolute = P_atmospheric + P_gauge
</div>

<h4>Fortin's Barometer</h4>
<p>Mercury column का उपयोग करके atmospheric pressure measure किया जाता है। Barometer में mercury reservoir और calibrated scale arrangement होता है।</p>

<div class="diagram">
<div class="diagram-title">Fortin's Barometer – Schematic</div>
