</div>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>Unit 5 Formula Sheet</h3>
<div class="formula">
Stress = F/A<br>
Strain = ΔL/L<br>
Y = longitudinal stress / longitudinal strain<br>
F_lim = μN<br>
P = F/A<br>
P_abs = P_atm + P_gauge<br>
h = 2Tcosθ/(ρgr)<br>
F_Stokes = 6πηrv<br>
Re = ρvD/η<br>
A₁v₁ = A₂v₂<br>
P + 1/2ρv² + ρgh = constant
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

