<section class="section topic" id="unit6">
<div class="container">
<div class="section-title">
<div class="eyebrow">Unit 6 · 10 Periods</div>
<h2>Heat and Thermometry / ऊष्मा एवं तापमिति</h2>
<p>Heat, temperature, transfer modes, temperature scales, expansion, thermal conductivity and thermometers.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="topic-header">
<div class="topic-number">6.1</div>
<div>
<h3>Concept of Heat and Temperature</h3>
<p>Heat energy transfer है; temperature thermal state का measure है।</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="two-lang">
<div>
<h4>Heat / ऊष्मा</h4>
<p>Heat is energy transferred because of a temperature difference. It is measured in joule in SI system.</p>
</div>
<div>
<h4>Temperature / तापमान</h4>
<p>Temperature किसी body की thermal condition बताता है और heat transfer की direction determine करने में मदद करता है। SI unit kelvin है।</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="note">Heat and temperature are not the same physical quantity. Heat is transferred energy; temperature is a state variable related to thermal condition.</div>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="topic-header">
<div class="topic-number">6.2</div>
<div>
<h3>Modes of Transfer of Heat</h3>
<p>Conduction, convection और radiation.</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="grid-3">
<div class="info-box">
<strong>Conduction</strong>
<span>Medium के bulk movement के बिना heat transfer. Solids में prominent.</span>
</div>
<div class="info-box">
<strong>Convection</strong>
<span>Fluid के bulk movement के साथ heat transfer.</span>
</div>
<div class="info-box">
<strong>Radiation</strong>
<span>Electromagnetic radiation द्वारा heat transfer; vacuum में भी हो सकता है।</span>
</div>
</div>

