<div class="card practical">
<h4>Practical 1 — Measure Length, Radius and Volume using Vernier Calipers</h4>
<div class="two-lang">
<div>
<h4>English</h4>
<p>Measure length/radius of a cylindrical body such as test tube or beaker using Vernier calipers and calculate volume.</p>
</div>
<div>
<h4>हिन्दी</h4>
<p>Vernier calipers की सहायता से cylindrical body की length और radius measure करें तथा volume calculate करें।</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="formula">Cylinder volume: V = πr²h</div>
<ol class="steps">
<li>Clean the instrument and object.</li>
<li>Check zero error.</li>
<li>Place object correctly between jaws.</li>
<li>Take main scale and Vernier scale readings.</li>
<li>Apply least-count correction if required.</li>
<li>Calculate dimensions and volume.</li>
</ol>
</div>

<div class="card practical">
<h4>Practical 2 — Diameter using Screw Gauge</h4>
<p><b>Aim:</b> To determine diameter of a wire and a solid ball using screw gauge.</p>
<div class="formula">Reading = Main Scale Reading + (Circular Scale Reading × Least Count) ± zero correction</div>
<ul>
<li>Check zero error.</li>
<li>Use ratchet carefully to avoid excess pressure.</li>
<li>Take multiple readings at different positions.</li>
<li>Find mean diameter.</li>
</ul>
</div>

<div class="card practical">
<h4>Practical 3 — Radius of Curvature using Spherometer</h4>
<p>Convex और concave mirror की radius of curvature determine करने के लिए spherometer use किया जाता है।</p>
<div class="formula">
R = l²/(6h) + h/2
</div>
<p>जहाँ l = distance between legs का mean side length और h = sagitta/depth relation के अनुसार measured height difference.</p>
</div>

<div class="card practical">
<h4>Practical 4 — Verify Parallelogram Law of Forces</h4>
<p>दो concurrent forces के resultant को experimental construction से verify करना।</p>
<div class="formula">R = √(P² + Q² + 2PQcosθ)</div>
<ul>
<li>Set two force directions at a known angle.</li>
<li>Apply known loads.</li>
<li>Find equilibrant.</li>
<li>Resultant is equal in magnitude and opposite in direction to equilibrant.</li>
</ul>
</div>

<div class="card practical">
<h4>Practical 5 — Coefficient of Friction between Wood and Glass</h4>
<p>Horizontal board पर wood block को pull करके limiting friction determine करना।</p>
<div class="formula">μ = F_lim/N</div>
<p>Horizontal setup में, if normal reaction approximately equals weight, N ≈ W.</p>
</div>

<div class="card practical">
<h4>Practical 6 — Atmospheric Pressure using Fortin's Barometer</h4>
<p>Fortin's Barometer से mercury column height read करके atmospheric pressure determine करना।</p>
<div class="formula">P = ρgh</div>
<ul>
<li>Instrument vertical रखें।</li>
<li>Reference adjustment करें।</li>
<li>Mercury level और scale reading carefully लें।</li>
<li>Parallax error avoid करें।</li>
</ul>
</div>

<div class="card practical">
<h4>Practical 7 — Viscosity of Glycerin by Stokes' Method</h4>
<p>Glycerin में sphere की terminal velocity observe करके coefficient of viscosity estimate करना।</p>
<div class="formula">
Stokes force = 6πηrv
</div>
<p>Experiment में terminal region, sphere radius, density difference और measurement uncertainties को ध्यान में रखें।</p>
</div>

<div class="card practical">
<h4>Practical 8 — Conservation of Mechanical Energy</h4>
<p>Potential energy के kinetic energy में conversion को observe करके mechanical energy conservation verify करना।</p>
<div class="formula">Total E = K.E. + P.E. ≈ constant</div>
</div>

<div class="card practical">
<h4>Practical 9 — Temperature using Mercury Thermometer</h4>
<p>Room temperature और hot bath temperature measure करें तथा different scales में convert करें।</p>
<div class="formula">
F = (9/5)C + 32<br>
K = C + 273.15
</div>
</div>

<div class="card practical">
<h4>Practical 10 — Force Constant of Spring using Hooke's Law</h4>
<p>Given syllabus में listed additional practical: spring पर load लगाकर extension measure करें और force constant determine करें।</p>
<div class="formula">
F = kx<br>
k = F/x
</div>

